  "releaseNotes": "--APR 2026: Added HttpClientExtensions and SocketExtensions, applied trimming annotations, and expanded benchmark coverage across extension methods.\n\t  --MAY 2026: Optimized ArrayExtensions (CRAP score analysis), refactored StringBuilderExtensions and member iteration for performance, and switched collection conversions to the range operator.\n\t  --JUN-JUL 2026: Added full benchmark coverage for all extension methods and improved trim safety and validation.\n\t  --AUG 2026: Improved SocketExtensions, added ColorExtensions.Average coverage, refreshed collection/string/type extension benchmarks, and marked many extension APIs as stable.",
